---
// Publication masthead: what this site is, in one heading and one serif line.
// The feed below is the content; there is no button row here.
---
<section class="hero container">
  <h1 class="hero-thesis">Reliability engineering for Rails and AI backends.</h1>
  <p class="hero-lede">
    Deep dives on the systems that have to stay correct when things go wrong:
    background jobs, Postgres, and AI backends. Each one is grounded in open-source
    code I build and ship.
  </p>
</section>

<style>
  .hero { padding-block: var(--space-16) var(--space-10); }
  .hero-thesis {
    font-size: var(--fs-4xl); font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.02; letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-5); max-width: 18ch;
  }
  .hero-lede {
    font-family: var(--font-prose);
    font-size: var(--fs-lg); line-height: var(--lh-normal); color: var(--text-muted);
    max-width: 58ch; margin: 0;
  }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .hero { padding-block: var(--space-10) var(--space-8); }
  }
</style>
